<header class="hubhero"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="kicker">The year, the Chinese way</div>
  <h1>Festivals</h1>
  <div class="zh">传 统 节 日</div>
  <p>Every Chinese festival hides a story — a goddess on the moon, a beast that fears red, a poet who gave his life to a river. Here is the whole year, with the legend, the food and the meaning behind each one.</p>
